{"unit_id": "tag:01ZY:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为概形（scheme）。假设下列条件之一成立。\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> 概形（scheme）<MATH_0002>是拟仿射的（quasi-affine）。\n<STRUCT_0003> 概形（scheme）<MATH_0003>同构（isomorphic）于一个局部闭子概形（closed subscheme），后者包含于某个仿射概形（affine scheme）中。\n<STRUCT_0004> <MATH_0004>上存在一个丰沛（ample）的可逆（invertible）层（sheaf）。\n<STRUCT_0005> 概形（scheme）<MATH_0005>同构（isomorphic）于<MATH_0006>的一个局部闭子概形（closed subscheme），其中<MATH_0007>是某个分次环（graded ring）。\n<STRUCT_0006>\n那么，对于任意有限（finite）子集（subset）<MATH_0008>，都存在仿射开集（affine open）<MATH_0009>，使得<MATH_0010>。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "quasi-affine", "target_term": "拟仿射的"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "isomorphic", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_term": "closed subscheme", "target_term": "闭子概形"}, {"source_term": "affine scheme", "target_term": "仿射概形"}, {"source_term": "ample", "target_term": "丰沛"}, {"source_term": "invertible", "target_term": "可逆"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "isomorphic", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_term": "closed subscheme", "target_term": "闭子概形"}, {"source_term": "graded ring", "target_term": "分次环"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限"}, {"source_term": "subset", "target_term": "子集"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "引入引理所讨论的对象。"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "第一项条件所涉及的对象。"}, {"source_term": "quasi-affine", "target_term": "拟仿射的", "context": "第一项条件中的概形性质。"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "第二项条件中同构的出发对象。"}, {"source_term": "isomorphic", "target_term": "同构", "context": "第二项条件中的同构关系。"}, {"source_term": "closed subscheme", "target_term": "闭子概形", "context": "此处受局部性限定，构成局部闭子概形。"}, {"source_term": "