{"unit_id": "tag:01ZY:proof", "translation": "根据《概形的性质（Properties）》中的定义<REF_0001>，拟仿射（quasi-affine）概形（scheme）作为拟紧开（quasi-compact open）子概形（subscheme）包含于某个仿射概形（affine scheme）中。任意仿射概形（affine scheme）<MATH_0001>都同构（isomorphic）于<MATH_0002>，其中<MATH_0003>按规定<MATH_0004>分次（graded）。由命题<REF_0002>，如果<MATH_0005>有一个丰沛（ample）的可逆（invertible）层（sheaf），那么<MATH_0006>同构（isomorphic）于<MATH_0007>的一个开子概形（open subscheme），其中<MATH_0008>是某个分次环（graded ring）。因此，只需证明情形（4）下的引理。（我们提请读者自行给出情形（2）的直接证明。）\n\n<STRUCT_0001><STRUCT_0002>\n于是，假设<MATH_0009>是局部闭子概形（closed subscheme），其中<MATH_0010>是某个分次环（graded ring）。设<MATH_0011>。回顾一下，标准开集（standard opens）<MATH_0012>构成<MATH_0013>上拓扑（topology）的一个基（basis）。由于<MATH_0014>是有限（finite）的，可以选取有限多个（finitely many）齐次（homogeneous）元素（elements）<MATH_0015>，使得\n<MATH_0016>\n假设<MATH_0017>，将其视为<MATH_0018>的子集（subset）。考虑理想（ideal）<MATH_0019>。由于<MATH_0020>对所有<MATH_0021>都成立，由《代数（Algebra）》中的引理<REF_0003>可知，存在一个齐次（homogeneous）元素（element）<MATH_0022>，使得<MATH_0023>对所有<MATH_0024>都成立。于是<MATH_0025>。由于<MATH_0026>与<MATH_0027>不相交，可知<MATH_0028>作为闭子概形（closed subscheme）包含于仿射概形（affine scheme）<MATH_0029>中，因而是所需的<MATH_0030>的仿射开集（affine open）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "Properties", "target_term": "概形的性质"}, {"source_term": "quasi-affine", "target_term": "拟仿射"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact open", "target_term": "拟紧开"}, {"source_term": "subscheme", "target_term": "子概形"}, {"source_term": "affine scheme", "target_term": "仿射概形"}, {"source_term": "affine scheme", "target_term": "仿射概形"}, {"source_term": "isomorphic", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_term": "graded", "target_term": "分次"}, {"source_term": "ample", "target_term": "丰沛"}, {"source_term": "invertible", "target_term": "可逆"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "isomorphic", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_term": "open subscheme", "target_term": "开子概形"}, {"source_term": "graded ring", "target_term": "分次环"}, {"source_term": "closed subscheme", "target_term": "闭子概形"}, {"source_term": "graded ring", "target_term": "分次环"}, {"source_term": "standard opens", "target_term": "标准开集"}, {"source_term": "topology", "target_term": "拓扑"}, {"source_term": "basis", "target_term": "基"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限"}, {"source_term": "finitely many", "target_term": "有限多个"}, {"source_term": "homogeneous", "target_term": "齐次"}, {"source_term": "elements", "target_term": "元素"}, {"source_term": "subset", "target_term": "子集"}, {"source_term": "ideal", "target_term": "理想"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "homogeneous", "target_term": "齐次"}, {"source_term": "element", "target_term": "元素"}, {"source_term": "closed subscheme", "target_term": "闭子概形"}, {"source_term": "affine scheme", "target_term": "仿射概形"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "Properties", "target_term": "概形的性质", "context": "所引用定义所在的章节名称。"}, {"source_term": "quasi-affine", "target_term": "拟仿射", "context": "所引用定义刻画的概形性质。"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "所引用定义刻画的对象。"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact open", "target_term": "拟紧开", "context": "用来刻画拟仿射概形的子概形性质。"}, {"source_term": "subscheme", "target_term": "子概形", "context": "拟仿射概形在仿射概形中的实现。"}, {"source_term": "affine scheme", "target_term": "仿射概形", "context": "定义所涉及的环境概形。"}, {"source_term": "affine scheme", "target_term": "仿射概形", "context": "接下来写成射影谱形式的对象。"}, {"source_term": "isomorphic", "target_term": "同构", "context": "任意仿射概形与所给对象之间的关系。"}, {"source_term": "graded", "target_term": "分次", "context": "所规定的环结构。"}, {"source_term": "ample", "target_term": "丰沛", "context": "所用命题中的层的正性。"}, {"source_term": "invertible", "target_term": "可逆", "context": "所用命题中的层的性质。"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层", "context": "所用命题假设存在的对象。"}, {"source_term": "isomorphic", "target_term": "同构", "context": "所用命题推出的关系。"}, {"source_term": "open subscheme", "target_term": "开子概形", "context": "所用命题给出的同构目标。"}, 